abstract: >-
  Code, data and manuscript for a bibliometric review of operations research on
  last-mile and on-demand delivery (168 articles, 2015-2026) and an optimisation
  case study of Bengaluru's quick-commerce dark-store network under delivery-promise
  and rider-speed constraints.
